  {
   "unit_type": "entry",
   "text": "Momcozy Wellness 1 Breast Pump | Wearable, Heated & Cordless | Warmth + Massage in One | Ease Engorgement Comfort | Soothe Tension as You Pump | Massage Synced To Suction | The First Heated Wearable | Promote Comfort Milk Flow | Comfort for Easier Let-Down | Skip the Complicated Setup | Momcozy Wellness | Momcozy® Wellness 1 | 2-Day Battery, Hands-Free | App Control & LED Screen | Covered by Insurance & FSA/HSA | Built-in warmth and gentle massage ease tension and make pumping feel soothing, not harsh. | Momcozy® The Industry-1st Warm-Massage Wearable Breast Pump, Insurance & HSA/FSA Eligible | Helping Moms Relax, Awaken the Body's the Natural Wisdom, Rebuild a Comfort&Flow Cycle | Simple, fuss-free setup—no learning curve. Pump hands-free, comfortably, anywhere.",
